<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugo M1 money supply rises in March vs Feb.</title>
<headline>Yugo M1 money supply rises in March vs Feb.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Yugoslavia reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>YUGOSLAV MONEY SUPPLY (in billions of dinars)</p>
<p>					  MAR	FEB    MAR 96</p>
<p> M1				    5.289    5.157    3.364</p>
<p> M2				    7.263    7.044    4.560</p>
<p> M3				   32.231   32.054   27.640</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 222 4305</p>
